hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1135","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Har daant wala darinda khana haram hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur ise Ibn Abbas ki hadees se is lafz se nikala ke mana farmaya; aur izafa kiya: Aur har panje wala parinda."
"1136","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke din gharailu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya, aur ghodon ke gosht ki ijazat di. Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke lafz mein hai: Aur ruksat di."
"1137","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abi Awfa se riwayat hai ke ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath saat ghazwe kiye jabke ham tiddiyan khate the. Muttafaq alaih."
"1138","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas se khargosh ke qisse mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: To use zabah kiya aur us ki raan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf bheji to Aap ne use qabool farmaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1139","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne janwaron mein se chaar ke qatl se mana farmaya: cheenti, shehed ki makkhi, hudhud aur shrike. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1140","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abi Ammar se riwayat hai ke main ne Jabir se kaha: Kya lakadbaggha shikar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Main ne kaha: Kya ise Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Han. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya, aur Bukhari aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1141","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se saahi ke bare mein poocha gaya to unhon ne kaha: Kaho ke main us mein haram nahin pata jo meri taraf wahi kiya gaya hai khane wale par jo khae... Al-aayat [Surah An'am: 145]. To un ke paas ek shaikh ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ko kehte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas is ka zikr hua to Aap ne farmaya: Gandi cheezon mein se ek gandi cheez hai. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"1142","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne gandagi khane wali aur us ke doodh se mana farmaya. Ise Arba'a ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"1143","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se جنگli gadhe ke qisse mein riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein se khaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1144","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ghoda zabah kiya aur use khaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke saanda Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dastarkhwan par khaya gaya. Muttafaq alaih."
"1146","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Usman Qarshi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek tabeeb ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mendak ke bare mein poocha jo woh dawa mein dalta tha, to Aap ne us ke qatl se mana farmaya. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1147","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kutta rakhe siwae bakriyon, shikar ya kheti ke kutte ke, us ke ajr se har din ek qeerat kam hota hai. Muttafaq alaih."
"1148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi bin Hatim (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujh se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum apna kutta chhodo to Allah ka naam lo; phir agar woh tumhare liye roke aur tum use zinda pao to use zabah karo; aur agar use mara hua pao aur us mein se khaya na gaya ho to use khao; aur agar apne kutte ke sath doosra kutta pao aur woh mara hua ho to na khao, kyunke tum nahin jante ke un donon mein se kis ne use mara hai; aur agar tum apna teer maro to Allah ka naam lo; phir agar woh tum se ek din ghaib rahe aur us mein siwae tumhare teer ke nishan ke kuch na pao to khao agar chaho; aur agar use pani mein dooba hua pao to na khao. Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Adi se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mi'raz ke shikar ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum us ki dhaar se lago to khao, aur jab tum us ke pahlun se lago aur woh mar jae to woh dab kar mara hua hai, to na khao. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'labah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apna teer maro aur woh tum se ghaib ho jae, phir use pao to use khao jab tak badbudar na ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1151","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ek qaum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak ek qaum hamare paas gosht lati hai, ham nahin jante ke us par Allah ka naam liya gaya hai ya nahin? To Aap ne farmaya: Tum us par Allah ka naam lo aur khao. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1152","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal Muzani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kankari phenkne se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Beshak woh na shikar karti hai na dushman ko zakhmi karti hai, lekin woh dant todti hai aur aankh phodti hai. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"1153","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi rooh wali cheez ko nishana na banao. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1154","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aurat ne pathar se bakri zabah ki. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne use khane ka hukm diya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"1155","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo khoon bahae aur us par Allah ka naam liya jae to khao, siwae dant aur nakhun ke; raha dant to haddi hai; aur raha nakhun to Habsha ki chhuriyan hain. Muttafaq alaih."
"1156","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwaron mein se kisi ko bandh kar qatl kiya jae. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1157","[AI-translation] Hazrat Shaddad bin Aws (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne har cheez par ehsan likh diya hai; to jab tum qatl karo to qatl achcha karo, aur jab tum zabah karo to zabah achcha karo; aur tum mein se koi apni chhuri tez kare aur apne zabeehe ko aaram de. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1158","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Janeen ka zabeeha us ki maan ka zabeeha hai. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1159","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye us ka naam kafi hai; phir agar woh bhool jae ke zabah karte waqt naam le to naam le, phir khae. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya, aur is ki sanad mein Muhammad bin Yazid bin Sinan hain jo sachche kamzor hafze wale hain; aur Abdur Razzaq ne ise Ibn Abbas tak sahih sanad se mauqoof riwayat kiya."
"1160","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) do chitkabre seengon wale mendhon ki qurbani farmate, naam lete, takbir kehte aur apna pair un ke pahlun par rakhte. Aur ek lafz mein hai ke un donon ko apne hath se zabah kiya. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek lafz mein hai ke mote taze the. Aur Abu Awanah ke han apne Sahih mein hai ke qeemti the, seen ki jagah se se. Aur Muslim ke ek lafz mein hai ke farmate: Allah ke naam se, Allahu akbar. Aur unhi ke han Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ki hadees se hai ke seengon wale mendhe ka hukm diya jo siyahi mein chalta, siyahi mein baithta aur siyahi mein dekhta, taake us ki qurbani den; to farmaya: Chhuri tez karo. Phir use li aur use litaya, phir use zabah kiya, aur farmaya: Allah ke naam se; Aey Allah Muhammad aur Aal Muhammad se aur Ummat Muhammad se qabool farma. Phir us se qurbani di."
"1161","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kushadgi rakhe aur qurbani na kare woh hamari eidgah ke qareeb na aae. Ise Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya, aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha; lekin aimma ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"1162","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jundub bin Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main Azha mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hazir tha; phir jab Aap logon se namaz se farigh hue to bakriyon ko dekha jo zabah ki gayi thin. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo namaz se pahle zabah kare woh us ki jagah bakri zabah kare; aur jo zabah na kiya ho woh Allah ke naam par zabah kare. Muttafaq alaih."
"1163","[AI-translation] Hazrat Bara bin Azib (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ham mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur farmaya: Chaar qurbaniyon mein jaez nahin hain: kana jis ka kanapan zahir ho, beemar jis ki beemari zahir ho, langdi jis ka langdapan zahir ho, aur tooti hui jo chalne na sake. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha."
"1164","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Siwae do-danta ke zabah na karo, siwae is ke ke tum par mushkil ho to bhed mein se ek saal ka zabah karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1165","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke aankh aur kaan dekhen, aur kani, kati-phati, pichhe kati, surakh wali aur tooti dant wali ki qurbani na den. Ise Ahmad aur Arba'a ne riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi, Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"1166","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke Aap ke unton par khada rahun, aur un ke gosht, khalen aur jhoolen miskeenon mein taqseem karun, aur un mein se qasai ki ujrat mein kuch na dun. Muttafaq alaih."
"1167","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah ke saal qurbani ki: unt saat ki taraf se, aur gae saat ki taraf se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"1168","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hasan aur Husain ki taraf se ek ek mendha aqeeqa kiya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah, Ibn Jarud aur Abdul Haqq ne ise sahih kaha; lekin Abu Hatim ne is ke mursal hone ko tarjeeh di. Aur Ibn Hibban ne Anas ki hadees se isi tarah nikala."
"1169","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen hukm diya ke ladke ki taraf se do barabar bakriyan aqeeqa ki jaen, aur ladki ki taraf se ek bakri. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha; aur Khamsa ne Umm Kurz Ka'biyah se isi tarah nikala."
"1170","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har bachcha apne aqeeqe se girwi hai; us ki taraf se saatwen din zabah kiya jae, sar mundwaya jae aur naam rakha jae. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
